  "tibetan_transliteration": "\u0f60\u0f51\u0f74\u0f63\u0f0b\u0f4a\u0f71\u0f72\u0f40\u0f0b\u0f60\u0f50\u0f51\u0f0b\u0f63\u0fa1\u0f53",
  "comments": "Instruction on monastic discipline ('dul ba), parts of which are considered distinct texts in some instances:\r\n1) dge slong gi rnam par 'byed pa gtan la dbab pa - in (ID:4681), fols. 1-100a7, (ID:8092), fols. 1-86a7.\r\n2) dge slong ma'i rnam par 'byed pa'i ti ka 'thad ldan - in (ID:8092), fols. 87-113a8, no equivalent in (ID:4681).\r\n3) spyir bstan rnam par 'byed pa'i ti ka 'thad ldan - in (ID:4681), fols. 100a8-135b1, partially (the end) in (ID:8098), fols. 150-182a3, almost complete (only the first folio is missing) in (ID:8097), fols. 2-29b4.\r\n4) bzhi bcu drug gi dam bsal bar bston pa'i ti ka 'thad ldan - in (ID:4681), fols. 135b1-185a3, (ID:4683), fols. +1-+44a7, (ID:8096), fols. 16a-42b6, incomplete (end missing) in (ID:8098), fols. 183a-225b.\r\n\r\nThis could be the work listed as \"'dul Tik\" by A khu ching shes rab rgya mtsho in his Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 536, No. 11708: bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar gyi 'dul Tik dang 'dul ba'i spyi don).",
  "alternative_names_legacy": "bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar gyis mdzad pa'i 'dul TIka 'thad ldan\r\nbya 'dul ba 'dzin pa chen pos mdzad pa'i 'dul Tik 'thad ldan zhes bya ba",
